0,east,"YOUR_PLAN

Explore the level, reach the stairs down. 
To solve this task I will start by heading east to see what's on the other side of the open door. Then, I will search the room for hidden doors and passages. After that, I will move south until I reach the stairs. If there are any challenges along the way (e.g. enemies, locked doors), I will either kick them to open them, or find alternative routes around them. If I have an issue with my current view (e.g. blocked by a vertical wall) I will move around to try to get a better view of my surroundings.","message:


